# Judge2-11-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:当时，负责管理钥匙的<br>应该是这位看守没错。|#0102Trial11_Warden001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那时<br>有发生什么事吗？|#0102Trial11_Warden002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Jailer Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:…………|#0102Trial11_Jailer001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:它怎么不说话呢？|#0102Trial11_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,ArmR2,ArmL7,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:快说点什么啊！|#0102Trial11_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Jailer.1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Jailer Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:…………|#0102Trial11_Jailer002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Margo.Default,ArmR5,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Margo Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:哎呀呀，<br>莫非是说不了话？|#0102Trial11_Margo001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.4
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这位确实<br>比较寡言……|#0102Trial11_Warden003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL9,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Middle,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……估计没法从【这东西】的嘴里<br>打听到话吧？|#0102Trial11_Coco002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:而且<br>一般来说，<br>它只听我的话。|#0102Trial11_Warden004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……那么，<br>我再问你<br>一个问题吧。|#0102Trial11_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Neutral_Open1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这位看守<br>有自己的意志吗。|#0102Trial11_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.3
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:至少它<br>不是机器。|#0102Trial11_Warden005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……难道，<br>你认为我们<br>杀了人？<br>我们可没有哦。|#0102Trial11_Warden006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"因为我们并没有<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_11_01\">动机</link>。<br>所以我们不可能<br>主动<link=\"Objection_01_02_11_02\">杀害某人</link>，<br>或者以<link=\"Objection_01_02_11_03\">共犯</link>的身份<br>协助某人作案。<br>|#0102Trial11_Warden007|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:因此，<br>希望凶手<br>可以老老实实地<br>报上名来，<br>我们将感激不尽……|#0102Trial11_Warden008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Comical_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:要是你一句话就能叫出来<br>我们还费什么劲……！|#0102Trial11_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Warden.11
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Warden Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:唉……<br>真是头疼啊。|#0102Trial11_Warden009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4


